# For the Dockerfile at the repository root, whose build context is the repository: only the Rust workspace, the
# data it reads and the examples go in. At the root because the classic builder (Colima's Docker has no
# BuildKit) reads only this file, never one beside the Dockerfile.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
!data
!examples
target
**/target
**/.env
